hmmm, it seems more than a few people stumble when they _first_
experiment with self-polymorph. i'm not sure i follow the reasoning
for wearing a ring that should change you and a ring that should
prevent you from changing altho if i didn't know better this might be
something i'd try for kicks.

protection from shape changers affects you only in the sense that
you see monsters for what they really are (in the event that they're
not what they seem).

a ring of polymorph has the obvious effect (self-polymorph occasionally).

although you may die from a system shock (being inexperienced and all),
a ring of shock resistance will not help in this matter. that ring works
against electric shock.

fortunately, there is a ring that will allow you to control your
polymorph tendencies, to a degree.

